# One line ending everywhere: files are checked out with LF on Windows too (GitHub's Windows machine
# otherwise turns them into CRLF), so tests that compare generated text with the files in the
# repository, such as the privacy text and the shared vectors, agree on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Third-party license texts stay byte for byte as cargo-about wrote them.
windows/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES-rust.txt -text
